{"data":[{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:58:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115624231073652822"],"id":"2115624231073652822","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":10405,"like_count":109,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":7},"text":"据研究，你亲密朋友的认知上限，往往也会限制你的认知高度。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115624231073652822"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:58:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115624159325860197","2115624588852048302"],"id":"2115624159325860197","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":565,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我转发批判一下。 https://t.co/eFqM1e0AhY","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115624159325860197"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:56:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115623889925763503"],"id":"2115623889925763503","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":7652,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":3},"text":"但就经济而言，未来仍旧是美国世纪。 https://t.co/Ko0qYha4ln","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115623889925763503"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:56:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115623682844528795"],"id":"2115623682844528795","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11931,"like_count":22,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"尽管美国仍旧是当今最伟大的国家，但形象开始褪色，川普总统功不可没。","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115623682844528795"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:52:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115622680070389948"],"id":"2115622680070389948","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5554,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"美联储28日结束为期两天的货币政策会议，宣布将联邦基金利率目标区间维持在3.75%至4%不变。这一决定符合市场此前广泛预期。\n同时沃什表达了深恶痛绝市场猜测他的意图，使得市场想要揣摩12月是否加息的征兆落空。","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115622680070389948"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:46:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115621235988242916"],"id":"2115621235988242916","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":13277,"like_count":68,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":1},"text":"谷歌的财报公布后，市场快速反应，对于AI产业净现金流的担忧，表露的淋漓尽致。\n华尔街已经不想猜AI大模型带来的未来净现金，先把融资成本入价。\n保不住现金流就跌。\n市梦率已经褪色。","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115621235988242916"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:44:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115620704330866717"],"id":"2115620704330866717","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":11439,"like_count":109,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":6},"text":"中国的很多父母，把孩子“孝心”和“赡养自己”绑定在一起，从小就开始PUA自己的孩子。但在这样父母教育的环境下，长大的孩子，基本上很难有自身的发展，也很难赚到钱。最终的结果，要么是孩子带着恨远离父母；要么是孩子一无是处，也没有能力照顾父母，开启晚年的持续对抗；真正既有“孝心”，又能赚钱的孩","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115620704330866717"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:42:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115620358422458730"],"id":"2115620358422458730","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5531,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我很好奇有算力期货的话，coreweave能否完成期货对冲。 https://t.co/pY7mlJpsgF","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115620358422458730"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115619318344134881"],"id":"2115619318344134881","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5672,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"鸡蛋呈现的carry结构，在套利上毫无意义，期限溢价完全失效，是因为保质期太短，远期合约与近月脱节，使得cash and carry交易无法操作。","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115619318344134881"},{"author_id":"855303666722525184","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:35:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115618374713770494"],"id":"2115618374713770494","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":85,"impression_count":7163,"like_count":96,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":12},"text":"10 个成人向 AI 绘图工具（18+）🔞 第二弹\n\n全是云端生成和模型站，不用本地部署\n\n1. Eternal AI（陪伴 + 图像 + 视频）\n   https://t.co/oa89KnRrJ3\n\n2. Promptchan（AI 聊天 + 图像 + 视频）\n   https://t.co/hEABhwH7X2\n\n3. SoulGen（图像 + 说话视频 + 修图）\n   https://t.co/bExvvJ7ODu\n\n4.","url":"https://x.com/wanerfu/status/2115618374713770494"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:34:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115618134250176624"],"id":"2115618134250176624","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":31,"impression_count":7209,"like_count":70,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":8},"text":"当一个人在群体里突然跳舞，旁边的人会用鄙夷的目光看着他。当第二个人加入，旁边的人开始动摇。当越来越多的人加入，原本鄙夷他的人，手也会不自觉地跟着舞动起来。从头到尾，跳舞的人没有变，跳舞这件事也没有变，改变的只是参与的人数。他最初因为别人不同于群体而鄙夷，最后因为自己不同于群体而焦","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115618134250176624"},{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115617112416735244"],"id":"2115617112416735244","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6767,"like_count":48,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":5},"text":"【中國人民銀行將發行中國京劇藝術普通紀念幣】中國人民銀行日前發布公告稱，定於2026年11月24日發行中國京劇藝術普通紀念幣一枚。此次將發行的中國京劇藝術普通紀念幣面額為5元，直徑為30毫米，材質為黃銅合金，發行數量為6000萬枚。 https://t.co/UwuaM0KEB4","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2115617112416735244"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:28:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115616791112360099"],"id":"2115616791112360099","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5529,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"苍老师思考了一下。 https://t.co/S2XEwXjjDg","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115616791112360099"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:27:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115616410886148553"],"id":"2115616410886148553","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5893,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"他声明自己是真正的巴西总统，发了一封公开信。 https://t.co/sznVGMq08F","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115616410886148553"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:24:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115615711494304102"],"id":"2115615711494304102","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":13821,"like_count":141,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":5},"text":"反诈人士被杀害的事情，从另外一个角度可以看到类似日本发生的现实：\n去中心化的分布式杀手组织。\n日本也曾多次出现网络招募，互相不认识的低层青年，临时组合抢劫或伤人。\n没想到在中国出现了。\n赛博末世的征兆。","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115615711494304102"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:21:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115614868929949789"],"id":"2115614868929949789","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2821,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"西班牙卡斯蒂利亚-拉曼查自治区政府28日说，当天上午在其首府托莱多发生的高速铁路列车相撞事故死亡人数上升至64人。 https://t.co/9wRpUK34ZW","url":"https://x.com/XinhuaChinese/status/2115614868929949789"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:20:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115614654731010094"],"id":"2115614654731010094","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":5915,"like_count":62,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":5},"text":"有人和我说：Morris，你发的帖子，很少评价一个人人，也很少给出确定性的答案。更多是理性、结构性的内容，这种东西很枯燥，没人愿意看。我说：我不追求流量，但也不拒绝流量。其实我的内容，愚蠢的人大多不喜欢看，因为他们无法理解世界的复杂性，也不希望得到复杂的答案。他们更喜欢简单的对错、明确","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115614654731010094"},{"author_id":"1938963008","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:17:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115614015951163887"],"id":"2115614015951163887","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":12751,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"礼来的下一代减肥药瑞他鲁肽是三重受体激活，同时靶向并激活GLP-1（胰高血糖素样肽-1）、GIP（葡萄糖依赖性促胰岛素多肽）以及GCGR（胰高血糖素受体）三种受体。\n\n在本周三公布的最新临床试验结果显示，其减重效果超过诺和诺德Ozempic 最高剂量的两倍以上。https://t.co/04ricYMLWH https://t.co/kCOmOYaqOQ","url":"https://x.com/HotmailfromSH/status/2115614015951163887"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:11:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115612534246191370"],"id":"2115612534246191370","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":25513,"like_count":146,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":48,"retweet_count":0},"text":"牧巴佩的事情真没那么严重。\n为前领导人的形象搭上中国好不容易在全球正面的形象，并不值得。\n感谢川普同志，他待不了几年。\n好好经营中国的形象吧。","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115612534246191370"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:05:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115611005665632410"],"id":"2115611005665632410","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5846,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不仅仅如此，中国人心中的德国人是工程师形象：严谨、勤劳、智慧、重视家庭。 https://t.co/NiqMFN7664","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115611005665632410"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:05:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115611003283251566"],"id":"2115611003283251566","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":57,"impression_count":15124,"like_count":148,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":17},"text":"我看到两位老人，一位70岁，一位80岁，都是普通人，却不约而同地卖掉了自己的房子，独自去探索世界。70岁的女性去了欧洲、南极，80岁的男性则染黄毛、逛夜店、开豪车和游艇，体验那些年轻时未曾经历的生活。他们让我意识到，人最大的遗憾，不是生命太短，而是把太多时间用于为生活做准备，却忘了真正去","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115611003283251566"},{"author_id":"1456122926432862223","created_at":"2026-10-29T01:04:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115610647102996712"],"id":"2115610647102996712","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":8908,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":0},"text":"美联储不加息的利好已经出完了，加密行情也没什么太大的波动\n\n接下来美国中期选举临近，其实加密行业担心监管风向会逆转\n\n未来一周很可能有血光之灾😅 https://t.co/dnY9H2NSZe","url":"https://x.com/giantcutie666/status/2115610647102996712"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"51904755","name":"Morris","username":"Morris_LT"},{"id":"31083308","name":"王海滨的财经闲谈","username":"wangwatchworld"},{"id":"855303666722525184","name":"摆烂程序媛","username":"wanerfu"},{"id":"1531801543","name":"人民日報  People's Daily","username":"PDChinese"},{"id":"3319804777","name":"New China 中文","username":"XinhuaChinese"},{"id":"1938963008","name":"Dr.Wang","username":"HotmailfromSH"},{"id":"1456122926432862223","name":"大漂亮| C Labs","username":"giantcutie666"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2115624231073652822","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlxo6mjd1j99px2iw7v5ipkrk519","oldest_id":"2115610647102996712","result_count":22}}
